  "description": "Notch C is our enduro eMTB built for those extra laps you always want but don’t always have the time or legs for. Its carbon fiber frame reduces weight and boosts stiffness for better power transfer and tracking. Paired with Bosch’s latest Performance Line CX drive unit and 625Wh battery, it’s a powerhouse combo that’s always tempting you to ride a little (or a lot) more.\n\nNotch features enduro-focused geometry, a 170mm of Split Pivot rear suspension travel and a 180mm fork for a stable, supportive, and efficient ride on rowdy terrain. Stay prepared for all those extra trail miles with Notch’s spare tube and multi-tool mount and enough frame space for a full water bottle or Bosch range extender battery.\n\nShimano’s Deore 12-speed drivetrain is a reliable workhorse with more than enough gear range for hauling up steep climbs or hoofing it across flat sections. It all comes together to make Notch C one of the best enduro eMTB options out there.\n\nMeets UL 2849, and UL 2271 certification",
